# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Seismic data -- NEVER commit these.
# The local Volve volumes alone are 3.4 GB and would blow past GitHub's
# 100 MB/file hard limit. Keep survey data outside the repo entirely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Volve/
data/
*.segy
*.sgy
*.SEGY
*.SGY
*.su
*.rsf
*.vds
*.zgy
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.zarr/
*.npy
*.npz

# Rendered output
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.mp4
*.gif
*.vtk
*.vti
*.vtu
*.vtp
renders/
screenshots/
!docs/**/*.png

